  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A scout warns a nearby ally about a clue just before their Perception check is resolved. Adds 1d4 to the ally's Perception check and spends the scout's reaction.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
